<title>THAILAND: TABLE-United Communication Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-United Communication Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.24	 vs	     2.94</p>
<p>    Net		    523.21	 vs	   686.90</p>
<p>					  Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     3.91	 vs	     5.84</p>
<p>    Net		    916.03	 vs	 1,366.93</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is United Communication Industry Plc, a telecommunication company.</p>
